  "claim": "The Mosuo Sisters takes place farther east then The Silent Historian.",
  "evidencia": "Page: The Mosuo Sisters. Sentence: The Mosuo Sisters is a 2012 documentary film written and directed by Marlo Poras.\nPage: The Mosuo Sisters. Sentence: Being an ethnic minority in China, the film explores their journey from working at a bar in Beijing to moving back home to their village in the Himalayas, dealing with the modern world impinging upon the traditional Mosuo culture and way of life.\nPage: The Silent Historian. Sentence: The Silent Historian (original title: \"Het zwijgen van Loe de Jong [The Silence of Loe de Jong]\") is a 2011 Dutch documentary film by Simonka de Jong, shown as part of the January 2012 New York Jewish Film Festival, presented in partnership with Jewish Museum and Film Society of Lincoln Center.",
